---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import MySiteLayout from "@layouts/MySiteLayout.astro"
import "@styles/2019/01-001.css"
import buildingImage from "@images/2019/01-001/building.jpg"
import logo from "@images/2019/01-001/logo.gif"
import darkGreyPaper from "@images/2019/01-001/dark-grey-paper.gif"
---

<MySiteLayout title="375 Park Ave" description="375 Park Ave">
  <main>
    <h1>375 PARK AVENUE</h1>
    <Image src={buildingImage} alt="375 Park Avenue" loading="eager" />
    <p>
      For firms seeking a significant New York address, this 38-story,
      air-conditioned building, first ever to be sheathed in rich enduring
      bronze and with its own half-acre landscaped plaza, is destined to become
      a business landmark throughout the nation. In architectural achievement,
      advanced installations and interior detailing, 375 Park Aveune brings into
      reality a concept of the office home never before attained. Reservations
      for available upper floors of 11,500 to 13,000 sq. ft. each are not being
      considered for late 1957 occupancy. For descriptive brochure and plans,
      write: Renting and Managing Agent,
    </p>
    <Image src={logo} alt="logo" />
    <p>281 Madison Avenue, New York 17, N.Y.</p>

    <footer>
      <span> being built by </span>
      <span class="seagram">THE HOUSE OF SEAGRAM</span>
    </footer>

    <Image src={darkGreyPaper} alt="dark grey paper" />
  </main>
</MySiteLayout>
